{
  "statement": "The SafetyAgent emphasizes the critical importance of safety and reliability in the ATM system. SAF-01 ensures no account can have a negative balance, protecting users from financial harm. SAF-02 mandates automatic fund withdrawal from savings if checking balances are insufficient, enhancing reliability. SAF-03 ensures users are informed and transactions are terminated if funds are inadequate, preventing unexpected outcomes. SAF-04 logs all transactions for accountability and auditing. SAF-05 implements secure PIN verification for user safety. SAF-06 allows limited withdrawals during maintenance, ensuring safe degradation. SAF-07 provides users with a clear summary of account status, enhancing transparency and trust.",
